1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,621
CHAPTER 5 — THE DESERT IN MEXICO

2
00:00:03,921 --> 00:00:12,676
In 1984, the first movie finally arrived. Directed by David Lynch, it was filmed in studios in Mexico City.

3
00:00:12,856 --> 00:00:18,743
It cost around $40 million, and in the United States it grossed less than $31 million.

4
00:00:19,243 --> 00:00:23,922
Critics tore it apart. Lynch ended up disowning it.

5
00:00:24,102 --> 00:00:31,876
But on opening day, right at the front of the line, stood a 17-year-old Canadian kid who had read the book at 13.

6
00:00:32,056 --> 00:00:36,207
He walked out thinking that someday, someone would try again.

7
00:00:36,957 --> 00:00:39,447
That someone was going to be him.
